	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - POWER INPUT\n\nUser USB-C receptacle (sink).\nCC1/CC2 -> STUSB4500 PD sink (NVM: PDO1 5V, PDO2 9V, PDO3 15V, 3A). I2C + ALERT to P4.\nVBUS -> TVS -> VBUS_USER (shunt, PM1 ch1) -> charger input.\nD+/D- -> ESD -> CP2102N (sheet USB User).\nOptional solder jumper: Dev VBUS -> VSYS via ideal diode (default OPEN)."
